          "description": "E_PM25J."
        },
        "E_pm_10": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/(m^2*s)",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "E_PM_10, unspeciated coarse PM (into OIN). The emiss_opt = 4 package does NOT carry this field, so under it WRF reads the dummy slot p_e_pm_10 = 1 of emis_ant, which holds 0: coarse OIN is never emitted (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N116). Kept as an input because other emission packages carry it."
        },
